<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>demonstrates<sp/>multiple<sp/>interrupt<sp/>handling<sp/>of<sp/>I2C,<sp/>SCI<sp/>&amp;<sp/>SPI<sp/>Digital<sp/>Loopback</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>program<sp/>is<sp/>used<sp/>to<sp/>demonstrate<sp/>how<sp/>to<sp/>handle<sp/>multiple<sp/>interrupts</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">when<sp/>using<sp/>multiple<sp/>communication<sp/>peripherals<sp/>like<sp/>I2C,<sp/>SCI<sp/>&amp;<sp/>SPI</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Digital<sp/>Loopback<sp/>all<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>example.<sp/>The<sp/>data<sp/>transfers<sp/>would</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">be<sp/>done<sp/>with<sp/>FIFO<sp/>Interrupts.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">It<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>internal<sp/>loopback<sp/>test<sp/>mode<sp/>of<sp/>these<sp/>modules.<sp/>Both</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">the<sp/>TX<sp/>and<sp/>RX<sp/>FIFOs<sp/>and<sp/>their<sp/>interrupts<sp/>are<sp/>used.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Other<sp/>than<sp/>boot<sp/>mode<sp/>pin<sp/>configuration,<sp/>no<sp/>other<sp/>hardware<sp/>configuration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">is<sp/>required.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">A<sp/>stream<sp/>of<sp/>data<sp/>is<sp/>sent<sp/>and<sp/>then<sp/>compared<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>received<sp/>stream.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>sent<sp/>data<sp/>looks<sp/>like<sp/>this<sp/>for<sp/>I2C<sp/>and<sp/>SCI:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">0000<sp/>0001</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">0001<sp/>0002</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">0002<sp/>0003</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">....</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">00FE<sp/>00FF</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">00FF<sp/>0000</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">etc..</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>sent<sp/>data<sp/>looks<sp/>like<sp/>this<sp/>for<sp/>SPI:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">0000<sp/>0001</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">0001<sp/>0002</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">0002<sp/>0003</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">....</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">FFFE<sp/>FFFF</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">FFFF<sp/>0000</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">etc..</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>pattern<sp/>is<sp/>repeated<sp/>forever.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>External<sp/>Connections</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>-<sp/>None</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
