<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>-<sp/><sp/>rDatai2cA<sp/>-<sp/>Received<sp/>I2C<sp/>data</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>-<sp/><sp/>rDataPoint<sp/>-<sp/>Used<sp/>to<sp/>keep<sp/>track<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>last<sp/>position<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>receive</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>I2C<sp/>stream<sp/>for<sp/>error<sp/>checking</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>-<sp/><sp/>sDataspiA<sp/>-<sp/>Data<sp/>to<sp/>send<sp/>through<sp/>SPI</highlight></codeline>
